        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black 24 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black 24 Inch Rectangular Door Handle is for use in commercial and residential applications. This pull has a rectangle grip shape, sometimes known as a ruler pull, because it is long and thiner. The grip of the Matte Black 24 Inch Door Handle is 24-1/8 inches long, 1-3/8 wide and 9/16 inches thick, so it is comfortable to hold. This 24 Inch Rectangle Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted and comes packed with the appropriate mounting hardware. You'll need to purchase 2 pulls if you want back to back mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTPULL24-size.gif?v=1704354587\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"24 Inch Rectangle Door Pull dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-36-inch-rectangular-door-handle\"><b>3 Foot Rectangle Matte Black Door Handle</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/matte-black-48-inch-rectangular-door-handle\"><b>4 Foot Rectangle Matte Black Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 24\" Rectangle Black Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/8\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\" (365 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Handle Diameter: 1-3/8\" x 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Post Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RTPULL24.pdf?v=1704262379\"><b>DWD-RTPULL24-622 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black 24 Inch Rectangular Door Handle",
                "description": "The Matte Black 24 Inch Rectangular Door Handle is for use in commercial and residential applications. This pull has a rectangle grip shape, sometimes known as a ruler pull, because it is long and thiner. The grip of the Matte Black 24 Inch Door Handle is 24-1/8 inches long, 1-3/8 wide and 9/16 inches thick, so it is comfortable to hold. This 24 Inch Rectangle Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted and comes packed with the appropriate mounting hardware. You'll need to purchase 2 pulls if you want back to back mounting.",
                "keywords": "Matte Black 24 Inch Door Handles, 24 Inch Rectangular Black Door Pulls, DWD-RTPULL24-622, 24 Inch Rectangular Black Door Pulls, 24 inch Rectangle Stainless Door Handle"
